你認為她不會想要拿起麥克風來唱歌

189
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:45,840
-time lover?
-時間情人？

190
00:07:46,580 --> 00:07:47,720
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

191
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,920
She's not gonna like the chicken that night, either, is she?
她也不會喜歡那天晚上的雞肉，對嗎？

192
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:54,460
You know what?
你知道嗎？

193
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,100
It's gonna be okay.
會沒事的。

194
00:07:56,260 --> 00:07:56,600
You know what?
你知道嗎？

195
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:58,100
She's probably not gonna even want to come.
她可能根本不想來。

196
00:07:58,780 --> 00:07:59,220
Really?
真的嗎？

197
00:07:59,540 --> 00:07:59,960
No.
不。

198
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:01,280
That was a lie.
那是一個謊言。

199
00:08:02,740 --> 00:08:04,520
See how easy that was?
看看那是多麼容易嗎？

200
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:06,400
So...
所以...

201
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:08,300
You would have just lied?
你剛剛會說謊嗎？

202
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:09,360
Yes.
是的。

203
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:11,540
Would it have really been that easy?
事情真的那麼容易嗎？

204
00:08:12,780 --> 00:08:13,220
Yes.
是的。

205
00:08:13,220 --> 00:08:13,920
Good.
好的。

206
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,800
So do it Saturday night, because we're going to dinner with her and
所以星期六晚上就這樣做吧，因為我們要跟她一起吃晚餐

207
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,080
Clark.
克拉克.

208
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:21,160
Nah-ah-ah-ah-ah-ah-ah!
啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！

209
00:08:31,900 --> 00:08:32,360
Hi.
你好。

210
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,000
What's wrong?
怎麼了？

211
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:37,380
People are doing it in front of my book!
人們在我的書前這樣做！

212
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:40,539
I'm sorry?
對不起？

213
00:08:40,539 --> 00:08:44,440
My doctoral dissertation is in the library at school.
我的博士論文在學校的圖書館。

214
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:49,000
I went to see it, and there were students making babies right in
我去看了，裡面有學生在生孩子

215
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,760
the middle of the paleontology section!
古生物學部分的中間！

216
00:08:51,660 --> 00:08:52,740
Oh, my God!
我的天啊！

217
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,380
Did you get to see anything good?
有看到什麼好東西嗎？

218
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:56,660
That is not the point.
這不是重點。

219
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:58,280
I know that's not the point.
我知道這不是重點。

220
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,620
I'm trying to make it the point.
我正在努力強調這一點。

221
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:01,780
Let me ask you something.
讓我問你一件事。

222
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:05,840
At your school, was there, uh, like a place on campus where students
在你們學校，呃，就像校園裡學生們聚集的地方一樣

223
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,580
went to to fool around?
去鬼混了？

224
00:09:07,580 --> 00:09:09,120
Yeah, there was.
是的，有。

225
00:09:09,260 --> 00:09:12,800
In the corner of the library, where all these dusty books were that
在圖書館的角落裡，那些滿是灰塵的書都放在那裡

226
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:15,500
nobody ever read, yes, there was.
沒有人讀過，是的，有。

227
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,040
Great.
偉大的。

228
00:09:17,260 --> 00:09:18,660
Because people kept showing up.
因為人們不斷出現。

229
00:09:18,780 --> 00:09:20,280
I think it's like a thing.
我覺得這就像一件事。

230
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,000
Now, hold on a second.
現在，請稍等。

231
00:09:22,900 --> 00:09:24,920
Fifth floor against that back wall?
五樓靠著後牆？

232
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,640
Oh, for crying out loud!
噢，大聲哭出來！

233
00:09:31,380 --> 00:09:31,820
Huh?
啊？

234
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,460
All right, so we should go catch our movie.
好吧，我們該去看電影了。

235
00:09:34,460 --> 00:09:35,660
Well, now, what's the rush?
好吧，現在急什麼？

236
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:37,640
I'd like to see the previews.
我想看預覽。

237
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:39,980
The candy.
糖果。

238
00:09:42,860 --> 00:09:43,900
Oh, hey.
哦，嘿。

239
00:09:44,220 --> 00:09:45,460
Well, look who's here.
好吧，看看誰在這裡。

240
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,020
Hey, Joey.
嘿，喬伊。

241
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:47,600
Hey, Erin.
嘿，艾琳。

242
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,160
Hey, Rachel.
嘿，雷切爾。

243
00:09:48,300 --> 00:09:48,780
Hi.
你好。

244
00:09:49,180 --> 00:09:51,560
Well, we were just about to take off and see a movie.
好吧，我們正準備起飛去看電影。

245
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,220
Oh, no!
哦，不！

246
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:54,600
What's wrong?
怎麼了？

247
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:56,400
Oh, Phoebe.
哦，菲比。

248
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:59,860
We forgot that party we have to go to.
我們忘記了我們要去參加的那個聚會。

249
00:10:00,140 --> 00:10:01,180
Oh, no.
哦，不。

250
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:03,860
What party?
什麼派對？

251
00:10:04,380 --> 00:10:05,500
A birthday party.
生日聚會。

252
00:10:07,100 --> 00:10:08,500
Whose birthday party?
誰的生日派對？

253
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,560
Allison's birthday party.
艾莉森的生日派對。

254
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:13,380
Oh.
哦。

255
00:10:13,660 --> 00:10:14,920
And how old is Allison?
艾莉森多大了？

256
00:10:15,260 --> 00:10:15,620
32.
32.

257
00:10:18,340 --> 00:10:21,240
I feel so terrible ditching you like this.
像這樣拋棄你我感覺很糟。

258
00:10:21,340 --> 00:10:21,940
No, that's okay.
不，沒關係。

259
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:23,600
Wait a minute.
等一下。

260
00:10:24,500 --> 00:10:25,880
Why don't you guys do something?
你們為什麼不做點什麼？

261
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:27,980
Look how that worked out.
看看效果如何。

262
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:34,220
If you want, do you want to catch a movie?
如果你願意的話，你想看電影嗎？

263
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:35,720
Yeah, sure, that'd be fun.
是的，當然，那會很有趣。

264
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:38,780
I guess I'll talk to you guys after Allison's party.
我想艾莉森的派對結束後我會和你們談談。

265
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:40,520
Oh, yeah, that actually might go late.
哦，是的，那實際上可能會晚一些。

266
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,460
I'll wait up.
我會等一下。

267
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:50,680
Excuse me.
打擾一下。

268
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,920
Hi, I'm a professor here.
你好，我是這裡的教授。

269
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:57,640
Do you know the paleontology section, fifth floor, stack 437?
你知道五樓437號棧古生物區嗎？

270
00:10:58,260 --> 00:10:59,400
Well, yes.
嗯，是的。

271
00:11:00,340 --> 00:11:01,500
Just give me five minutes.
給我五分鐘。

272
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:03,640
I just have to find someone to cover my shift.
我只需要找個人來代替我輪班。

273
00:11:07,220 --> 00:11:08,700
No, no, no.
不，不，不。

274
00:11:10,100 --> 00:11:12,060
Can I speak to someone in charge, please?
我可以和負責人通話嗎？

275
00:11:16,100 --> 00:11:16,960
How can I help you?
我怎麼幫你？

276
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:22,220
Hi, I was wondering, is it possible to increase security in the paleontology
你好，我想知道是否有可能提高古生物學的安全性

277
00:11:22,220 --> 00:11:22,680
section?
部分？

278
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:26,320
See, I wrote a book that's up there, and instead of reading it,
看，我寫了一本書，上面有，但我沒有讀它，

279
00:11:26,420 --> 00:11:30,020
people are, well, they're rolling around in front of it.
人們，好吧，他們在它前面打滾。

280
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:34,460
We are aware of the problem you're referring to.
我們知道您提到的問題。

281
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:44,040
But as far as increasing security, I'm afraid the library is very understaffed.
但就加強安全性而言，恐怕圖書館人手嚴重不足。

282
00:11:44,140 --> 00:11:45,740
I can't help you.
我幫不了你。

283
00:11:46,820 --> 00:11:47,500
Well, fine.
好吧，好吧。

284
00:11:48,060 --> 00:11:48,500
Fine.
美好的。

285
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:52,680
If I'm the only person with any appreciation of the sanctity of the
如果我是唯一一個欣賞神聖事物的人

286
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:54,840
written word, then I'll go up there and defend it myself.
書寫文字，然後我會親自去那裡捍衛它。

287
00:11:56,060 --> 00:11:57,420
Don't you follow me.
你別跟著我。

288
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:01,280
Hey.
嘿。

289
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:02,200
Hey.
嘿。

290
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,900
How did it go with Aaron?
亞倫的事怎麼樣了？

291
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:05,120
Unbelievable.
難以置信。

292
00:12:06,020 --> 00:12:07,340
We had the best time.
我們度過了最美好的時光。

293
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:08,080
Yay!
耶！

294
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:10,720
Oh, so you're not mad at us anymore.
哦，所以你不再生我們的氣了。

295
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:11,660
No, no, no.
不，不，不。

296
00:12:11,700 --> 00:12:12,760
You guys are totally right.
你們是完全正確的。

297
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:15,040
This was so much better than the first time we went out.
這比我們第一次出去好多了。

298
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,440
You know, that was so awkward.
你知道，那太尷尬了。

299
00:12:16,580 --> 00:12:17,880
We were both really nervous.
我們都很緊張。

300
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:19,100
Didn't you sleep together?
你們沒一起睡嗎？

301
00:12:19,380 --> 00:12:20,700
Yeah, that really calms me down.
是的，這確實讓我平靜下來。

302
00:12:20,700 --> 00:12:21,220
Oh.
哦。

303
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:25,260
And we have so much in common.
我們有很多共同點。

304
00:12:25,700 --> 00:12:31,140
She loves sandwiches, sports, although she is a MET fan.
儘管她是 MET 粉絲，但她喜歡三明治和運動。

305
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:33,020
Not much of an issue now, but if we were ever to have
現在不是什麼大問題，但如果我們曾經有過

306
00:12:33,020 --> 00:12:33,820
kids...
孩子們...

307
00:12:33,820 --> 00:12:34,860
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

308
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:38,040
Listen to you talking about having kids.
聽你說起生孩子的事。

309
00:12:38,680 --> 00:12:40,220
Oh, my Joey.
哦，我的喬伊。

310
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:43,140
Oh, please don't get married before I do.
哦，請不要在我結婚前結婚。

311
00:12:50,700 --> 00:12:52,720
Oh, oh, oh.
哦，哦，哦。

312
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:57,620
Oh, I just cannot believe that Clark stood me up.
哦，我簡直不敢相信克拉克竟然放我鴿子。

313
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,300
He may still show up.
他可能還會出現。

314
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:00,460
Oh, what are you, stupid?
哦，你是什麼，傻瓜？

315
00:13:01,780 --> 00:13:03,480
It's been three hours.
已經三個小時了。

316
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:04,700
Is that all?
這就是全部嗎？

317
00:13:06,060 --> 00:13:07,680
I just feel like such a fool.
我只是覺得自己像個傻瓜。

318
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:10,280
You know, I really, I thought this guy was my soulmate.
你知道，我真的，我認為這個人是我的靈魂伴侶。

319
00:13:10,680 --> 00:13:11,900
But I was your soulmate.
但我是你的靈魂伴侶。

320
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:14,660
What am I doing?
我在做什麼？

321
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:20,300
Oh, you know, let's just, oh, let's forget about Clark.
哦，你知道，讓我們，哦，讓我們忘記克拉克。

322
00:13:20,460 --> 00:13:23,020
Let's just go on to happier things, okay?
讓我們繼續做更快樂的事吧？

323
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:26,000
Um, why don't you tell me about your lovely wedding?
嗯，為什麼不告訴我你可愛的婚禮呢？

324
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:29,980
Well, actually, uh, there was something that we wanted to tell you about
嗯，實際上，呃，我們想告訴你一些事情

325
00:13:29,980 --> 00:13:30,400
the wedding.
婚禮。

326
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:35,040
Um, it's going to be a small ceremony.
嗯，這將是一個小型儀式。

327
00:13:35,420 --> 00:13:36,280
Uh, tiny.
呃，很小。

328
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:40,160
We're not even sure why we're having it.
我們甚至不確定為什麼會這樣。

329
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:44,260
It's actually going to be just family.
事實上，這只是一家人。

330
00:13:45,940 --> 00:13:48,440
Oh, wait.
哦，等等。

331
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:53,220
You two think of me as family?
你們兩個把我當家人嗎？

332
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:59,840
Oh, I have to ask you something now and be honest.
哦，我現在必須問你一件事，而且要誠實。

333
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:04,980
Do you want me to sing Careless Whisper or Lady in Red?
你想讓我唱《粗心細語》或《紅衣女郎》嗎？

334
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,680
How can you say that?
你怎麼能這麼說呢？

335
00:14:09,980 --> 00:14:11,200
The Mets have no closer.
大都會隊沒有更接近的機會。

336
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:12,080
What about Benitez?
貝尼特斯呢？

337
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:14,600
What about Game 1 of the series?
該系列的第一場比賽怎麼樣？

338
00:14:14,900 --> 00:14:15,860
What about Shut Up?
閉嘴怎麼樣？

339
00:14:16,020 --> 00:14:17,020
You shut up.
你閉嘴。

340
00:14:18,180 --> 00:14:19,520
I'm arguing with her.
我正在和她爭論。

341
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:21,100
I'll be right back.
我馬上回來。

342
00:14:21,180 --> 00:14:21,380
Okay.
好的。

343
00:14:23,660 --> 00:14:26,620
So, how's the second greatest love affair of the century?
那麼，本世紀第二偉大的愛情故事怎麼樣呢？

344
00:14:27,400 --> 00:14:28,000
The second?
第二個？

345
00:14:28,100 --> 00:14:28,640
Who's the first?
誰是第一名？

346
00:14:29,140 --> 00:14:30,060
Me and this muffin.
我和這個鬆餅。

347
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,120
My God, it's delicious.
天哪，真好吃。

348
00:14:32,800 --> 00:14:34,300
So, how's it going with Joe?
那麼，喬的情況怎麼樣呢？

349
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:36,180
Uh, okay.
呃，好吧。

350
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:37,520
Okay.
好的。

351
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,000
Wait.
等待。

352
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:39,840
Okay.
好的。

353
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:40,340
Tell me.
告訴我。

354
00:14:40,500 --> 00:14:41,460
Tell me that you like him, please.
請告訴我你喜歡他。

355
00:14:41,580 --> 00:14:42,620
Tell me that you like him.
告訴我你喜歡他。

356
00:14:42,980 --> 00:14:46,900
Look, he's a really great guy and I know that you really want
聽著，他是一個非常棒的人，我知道你真的想要

357
00:14:46,900 --> 00:14:49,920
this to work out, but I just don't see this having a future.
這個解決方案，但我只是不認為它有未來。

358
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:54,820
But you said that you liked him.
但你說過你喜歡他。

359
00:14:54,940 --> 00:14:55,900
I mean, what happened?
我的意思是，發生了什麼事？

360
00:14:56,220 --> 00:14:58,600
Did you just change your mind?
你剛剛改變主意了嗎？

361
00:14:59,440 --> 00:14:59,840
Kinda.
有點。

362
00:15:00,260 --> 00:15:01,340
Then change it back!
那就改回來吧！

363
00:15:03,300 --> 00:15:04,100
I'm sorry.
對不起。

364
00:15:04,420 --> 00:15:06,840
It's just there's no real spark.
只是沒有真正的火花。

365
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:07,860
No spark?
沒有火花？

366
00:15:07,960 --> 00:15:08,880
Didn't you sleep together?
你們沒一起睡嗎？

367
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:09,840
Yeah.
是的。

368
00:15:10,580 --> 00:15:11,380
Ah, tramp.
啊，流浪漢。

369
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:15,900
Does Joey have any idea?
喬伊有什麼想法嗎？

370
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:17,420
I really don't think he does.
我真的不認為他這樣做。

371
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:18,040
And you know what?
你知道嗎？

372
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:20,320
Maybe you guys could help clue him in.
也許你們可以幫他找出線索。

373
